  "description": "Home Club are delighted to present this beautifully presented two-bedroom, first-floor apartment to the rental market, ideally located within the highly sought-after The Printworks development in Bray. Extending to approximately 56 sq. m. (607 sq. ft.), the apartment offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation finished to a high standard throughout. The property is fully furnished with quality fixtures and fittings, creating a comfortable and stylish living environment. The apartment is situated within a secure, gated development and benefits from beautifully maintained landscaped communal gardens.\nThe location is second to none, with Bray Town Centre, SuperValu Shopping Centre, Lidl and Bray Promenade all within easy walking distance. There is also an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants and local amenities nearby. For commuters, the property is ideally positioned close to excellent transport links, including numerous Dublin Bus routes and Bray DART Station, providing convenient access to Dublin city centre and surrounding areas.\n\nFeatures\nBright first-floor apartment\nTwo spacious double bedrooms\nMaster bedroom with ensuite\nFully furnished\nQuality fixtures and fittings\nSecure gated development\nLandscaped communal gardens\nApprox. 56 sq. m. (607 sq. ft.)\nWalking distance to Bray Town Centre\nWalking distance to Bray Promenade\nClose to SuperValu and Lidl\nExcellent selection of cafés, restaurants and local amenities nearby\nClose to schools\nExcellent public transport links\nBray DART Station within easy reach\nNumerous Dublin Bus routes nearby\nParking space included\nStrictly no pets.",
